S129 EXACT n=21 GRAPH6 ENDPOINT-UNIVERSALITY AUDIT
====================================================

Question: can the remaining u(22) proof be finished by showing that
57-edge n=21 cores lose their unit Hamiltonian spine under one-vertex
extension?  The graph-only answer below is no: the exact cores are
endpoint-universal.

