GRAPH-ONLY EXTENSION READOUT
----------------------------
core 1: degree-4 neighbor sets endpoint-compatible 5985/5985; degree-5 sets 20349/20349
core 2: degree-4 neighbor sets endpoint-compatible 5985/5985; degree-5 sets 20349/20349
