ASSUMPTION CHALLENGE
--------------------
Alternate vertices considered: graph vertices, deletion ears, endpoint masks,
4-subsets of core vertices, candidate extension centres, unit-cocyclic sets,
and totally-unfaithful obstruction packets.  The graph quotient preserves
traceability and endpoint universality but destroys planar realization and
circle-centre/cocyclicity constraints.  That destroyed geometry is exactly
where the remaining u(22) proof has to live.

